      value: NPC
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue1.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue2.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[0]'
      value: I've made a huge mistake...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[1]'
      value: I spent all my money on this god awful color palette.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[2]'
      value: Now I'm broke... my life is over...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[3]'
      value: Huh? You need money? For college?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[4]'
      value: Read the room! My problems are more important!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[0]'
      value: I should probably change the sign out front...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[1]'
      value: But that would cost money, which I don't have.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[2]'
      value: Augh!!!!!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
